      "op": "note",
      "text": "qa-ftue-day1 (night 2026-11-07): day 1 as a new player, by what the screen says only. A still at every step at 1920x1080, and at 1280x1024 at the main steps. The run does what each hint says with the virtual mouse and keys where the rig can (click, counterDrag, key), so a covered click box fails the presses assertion. Round 2: the rulebook is the painted red book (Desk_RulebookFolded; a click brings the folder out), Esc is left out (Esc opens the PC's Settings by design), the wheel is opened by the intercom in the office view with the PC shut, and closing time needs the traveller at the desk decided (DecideCorrectly) before the ledger. The wrong verdict lets in a traveller who should be turned away (textLangWrongCall, the desk's own verdict path); the citation is acknowledged by its own button. Home's Sleep is RunManager.Sleep (the rig has no bed op). Do not fix: the findings go to BUGS."
